1245
01:14:36,175 --> 01:14:40,965
Calculated, planned, premeditated.

1246
01:14:42,295 --> 01:14:45,334
These are the words that come to mind
in relation to the killing

1247
01:14:45,335 --> 01:14:46,855
of Barry Baylis.

1248
01:14:46,935 --> 01:14:50,494
"To prevent possible future victims
from being hurt,"

1249
01:14:50,495 --> 01:14:53,774
was Alan Ferns' reason to the killing.

1250
01:14:53,775 --> 01:14:56,334
But Mr Baylis was putting
no one's life at risk.

1251
01:14:56,335 --> 01:14:59,881
No on was being protected from a crime.

1252
01:15:00,415 --> 01:15:03,574
Possibly, he may have gone
out of prison and offended.

1253
01:15:03,575 --> 01:15:06,135
Anything is possible.

1254
01:15:06,215 --> 01:15:09,175
We cannot permit executions

1255
01:15:09,255 --> 01:15:13,801
on the basis of personal speculation
by Alan Ferns.

1256
01:15:14,335 --> 01:15:17,374
The question
we have to grapple with is this.

1257
01:15:17,375 --> 01:15:22,135
Is it ever right to take the law
into your own hands?

1258
01:15:22,215 --> 01:15:25,925
To allow a self-righteous, superior man

1259
01:15:26,015 --> 01:15:29,935
to decide and plan
the execution of another?

1260
01:15:32,255 --> 01:15:36,454
If we allow this,
we will be writing a licence for mayhem

1261
01:15:36,455 --> 01:15:39,455
to vigilante hard men like Ferns,

1262
01:15:39,895 --> 01:15:45,077
permitting storms of double wrongs
trying to make a right.

1263
01:15:46,215 --> 01:15:48,814
My client's case
is that he struck at Barry Baylis

1264
01:15:48,815 --> 01:15:53,452
to prevent the certain death
or serious sexual abuse

1265
01:15:53,455 --> 01:15:55,365
of another child,

1266
01:15:55,455 --> 01:16:00,814
which our justice system
either could not or would not prevent.

1267
01:16:00,815 --> 01:16:03,694
The law entitles you
to defend yourself or another

1268
01:16:03,695 --> 01:16:09,374
if a certain or unpreventable attack
will be committed upon you.

1269
01:16:09,375 --> 01:16:10,774
I'm not allowed to tell you

1270
01:16:10,775 --> 01:16:14,854
