1293
01:17:46,335 --> 01:17:49,725
or to cause serious bodily harm.

1294
01:17:51,415 --> 01:17:53,854
The defence here is self-defence.

1295
01:17:53,855 --> 01:17:57,215
To prevent death or serious injury,

1296
